    native_doctest_route_rejects_declaration_only_and_main_examples_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 OPEN. --sdoctest --native-backend=<b> (the only doctest route a Stage 2 producer can serve) rejects declaration-only examples ('native-plain: no executable body') and main-defining examples ('native-spec: source defines main') that the interpreter route passes: doc/07_guide/quick_reference 13 blocks -> 0 passed/10 errors natively vs 6 passed/4 failed on the seed. Cause: native_framework_wrapper.spl partition rules. Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/native_doctest_route_rejects_declaration_only_and_main_examples_2026-11-12.md."

